# vehje. public API and composition

The framework's public crate and front door: the two plug-in contracts a
consumer builds against (the `Grammar` input-side contract, the `Target`
output-side re-export), the orchestration that is the dev-time language compiler
(the per-program path through resolve, check, lower, and emit; the per-language
path through the signature to runtime generation; the check-and-lower interleave
routed through IR grade annotations), the compile-time distribution composition
that links a set of targets with no `dyn`, and a reference distribution
(`DebugTarget`) exercising the whole pipeline. `#![no_std]`, no alloc.
